# leancompcert-evidence.local.cfg — developer override (do not check in)
#
# Read after leancompcert-evidence.cfg; its keys win.  Copy this file to
# leancompcert-evidence.local.cfg to use it.
#
# The local default: use the stamp if a previous run exists, otherwise run the
# artifact now.  `cache` precedes `run` on purpose — a build you repeat should
# stay a stamp check.  Put `run` first only when you want the computation
# actually performed.
policy = cache, run
